OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, the rain occasionally heavy.
OL,7,FSome drier and brighter spells, the
OL,8,Fbest of these developing across Moray
OL,9,Fand western Aberdeenshire.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain possible
OL,12,Facross Aberdeen and the east, the rain
OL,13,Fsoon moving into the North Sea. Clear
OL,14,Fspells developing and winds mainly
OL,15,Flight and rather chilly by dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FEarly bright or sunny
OL,18,Fspells, but cloud building with heavy
OL,19,Fshowers developing. The showers
OL,20,Fpossibly merging at times with the
OL,21,Frisk of the odd thunderstorm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
